{"id":73606,"date":"2026-11-09T16:50:56","date_gmt":"2026-11-09T16:50:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73606"},"modified":"2026-11-09T17:53:25","modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T16:53:25","slug":"trilho-de-s-tome","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-de-s-tome\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027<\/strong> (13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> junto \u00e0s instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Helenos, S.A., em <strong>Ferreira-a-Nova<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Figueira da Foz<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo Ferreirense<\/strong>, em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio da Figueira da Foz e a Junta de Freguesia de Ferreira-a-Nova, contando com homologa\u00e7\u00e3o da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (Certificado n.\u00ba 725).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra tr\u00eas vertentes com chegada junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia e \u00e0 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural, Recreativa e Desportiva de Ferreira-a-Nova: o <strong>Trail Curto \/ Sprint K20 (20 km, 400 m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 09:30 \u2014 integrado no Circuito Nacional de Trail Sprint da FPA e no Circuito Distrital de Trail Curto da ADAC \u2014, o <strong>Mini Trail K12 (12 km, 197 m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 10:15, e a <strong>Caminhada (12 km, 197 m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 09:30, percorrendo trilhos de terra batida, single tracks, aceiros e estrad\u00f5es da Mata Nacional de Foja e Liceia.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos (em regime de autossufici\u00eancia de recipiente), banhos na piscina da Junta de Freguesia e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio completo (sopa, bifana, arroz doce e bebida). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ferreira-a-Nova, Figueira da Foz, Coimbra<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 km e 12 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direc