ign: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00\u20ac \u2014 c\/ almo\u00e7o<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,50\u20ac \u2014 c\/ almo\u00e7o<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada K12 (12 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00\u20ac \u2014 c\/ almo\u00e7o<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,50\u20ac \u2014 c\/ almo\u00e7o<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 realiza-se no dia 10 de Janeiro de 2027 (Domingo), em Ferreira-a-Nova, concelho da Figueira da Foz (Coimbra). A partida tem lugar junto \u00e0s instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Helenos, S.A. (\u00e0s 09:30 para o Trail K20 e Caminhada, e \u00e0s 10:15 para o Mini Trail K12) e a meta situa-se junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia de Ferreira-a-Nova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de tr\u00eas percursos: Trail K20 com 20 km e 400 m D+ (tempo limite de 4h00), Mini Trail K12 com 12 km e 197 m D+ (tempo limite de 2h30) e Caminhada com 12 km e 197 m D+. O Trail K20 \u00e9 homologado pela FPA e pontua para o Circuito Nacional de Trail Sprint da FPA e para o Circuito Distrital de Trail Curto da ADAC.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 27 de dezembro de 2026), o Trail K20 custa 18,50\u20ac (17,00\u20ac para federados ADAC), o Mini Trail K12 custa 15,00\u20ac e a Caminhada 12,00\u20ac. Na 2\u00aa fase (de 28 de dezembro de 2026 a 5 de janeiro de 2027), os valores passam para 20,00\u20ac (18,50\u20ac federados ADAC) no Trail K20, 16,50\u20ac no Mini Trail K12 e 13,50\u20ac na Caminhada. Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio completo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na Junta de Freguesia de Ferreira-a-Nova no s\u00e1bado, 9 de janeiro de 2027, das 19:00 \u00e0s 21:00, e no domingo, dia da prova (10 de janeiro de 2027), a partir das 08:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e onde est\u00e3o localizados os abastecimentos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes devem transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos com capacidade m\u00ednima de 500 ml, apito e telem\u00f3vel operacional (sendo recomendados manta t\u00e9rmica e corta-vento). O Trail K20 conta com abastecimentos aos 7 km (Liceia), 14 km (Fonte da Mata) e na meta; o Mini Trail K12 e a Caminhada t\u00eam abastecimento aos 7 km e na meta. N\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ferreira-a-Nova, Figueira da Foz\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Figueira da Foz\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O XIII Trilho de S. Tom\u00e9 2027 realiza-se a 10 de janeiro em Ferreira-a-Nova, Figueira da Foz. Provas de Trail 20 km, Mini Trail 12 km e Caminhada 12 km.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/trilho-de-s-tome-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto \/ Sprint K20\", \"price\": \"18.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.runmanager.net\/Eventos\/xiii-trilho-de-s-tome-27\/1075\", \"validFrom\": \"